---
import PolicyLayout from '../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro';
---

<PolicyLayout title="Privacy information">
  <h2>Contact and estimate requests</h2>
  <p>
    The estimate form is currently in preview mode. Entries are not sent or
    saved by the form. Contact details are being updated. This notice will be
    updated when online estimate requests are enabled.
  </p>
  <h2>Google Maps reviews</h2>
  <p>
    When the review section approaches your screen, this website requests public
    business reviews through its server. Review text, names, and dates are
    displayed for that page visit, without storing a local review database or a
    browser cache of the review response. Reviewer images load from Google;
    Google receives the information normally associated with an image request,
    such as your IP address and browser details.
  </p>
  <p>
    The{' '}
    <a
      href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      Google Privacy Policy
    </a>{' '}
    is incorporated here for the Google Maps feature. Following a review or
    profile link opens Google, where Google’s policies apply.
  </p>
  <h2>Website operation</h2>
  <p>
    Hosting infrastructure processes technical request information to deliver
    the website and protect it from abuse. This preview does not include
    advertising trackers, an analytics script, or a marketing-cookie system.
  </p>
  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>
    Contact details for questions about this website will be provided before
    online requests are enabled.
  </p>
</PolicyLayout>
